        &nbsp;<a href="post.asp?method=ReplyQuote&REPLY_ID=5217&TOPIC_ID=919&FORUM_ID=4&CAT_ID=1&Forum_Title=The+Round+Table&Topic_Title=I%27ve+been+thinking+in+the+past&M="><img src="icon_reply_topic.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Reply with Quote" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Well put, Lling.  I feel the same way about the raid issue.  The level limit is not in place to exclude our lower level friends, it is there for the safety of the raid.  On raids where it is not a matter of life or death, a few lower level people can really add to the experience.  The fire giant raid, for example, would be fine with a couple lower level clerics.</P><P>Ealadan Azurefire<BR>Keeper of Tears<BR>Eyes of Tunare<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
