        &nbsp;<a href="post.asp?method=ReplyQuote&REPLY_ID=5221&TOPIC_ID=919&FORUM_ID=4&CAT_ID=1&Forum_Title=The+Round+Table&Topic_Title=I%27ve+been+thinking+in+the+past&M="><img src="icon_reply_topic.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Reply with Quote" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> The game has level limits.  Not everyone can be the same level as everyone else.  Lore Keepers is not a 46+ guild, but we do have characters who are that level!  There are many people within each level range so that everyone will have a chance to group with their fellow guild members.  People just need to take some initiative and coordinate groups around their level.  We can't count on Browso to set up everyone's groups for them.</P><P>Ealadan Azurefire<BR>Keeper of Tears<BR>Eyes of Tunare<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
