        &nbsp;<a href="post.asp?method=ReplyQuote&REPLY_ID=5225&TOPIC_ID=919&FORUM_ID=4&CAT_ID=1&Forum_Title=The+Round+Table&Topic_Title=I%27ve+been+thinking+in+the+past&M="><img src="icon_reply_topic.gif" height=15 width=15 alt="Reply with Quote" border="0" align="absmiddle" hspace="6"></a>


        <hr noshade size="1">
        
        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Shizue I was not refering to your post specifically.  I'm sorry there are not so many lower level raids.  I'd like to attend some low level raids with my level 31 paladin, but I do not play him because I want to keep him the same level as my girlfriend's character.  </P><P>I'll work on getting at least 1 of my other characters up in the high 20s so I can join in on some of these events, or maybe even create some.  Ealadan comes first though, because he is my main character, and I like grouping with all the great friends I've made in this guild while playing my wizzy.</P><P>Ealadan Azurefire<BR>Keeper of Tears<BR>Eyes of Tunare<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
